      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "When you feel like a broken program, it is an understandable way to frame overwhelming pain, but please resist viewing yourself as something that can simply be deleted. Those intense feelings of numbness and pointlessness are symptoms of profound distress, not accurate descriptions of your inherent worth. There are ways to interrupt this loop, and people who want to help you debug the emotional system you are currently running on. Please reach out to a hotline like the 988 Suicide & Crisis Lifeline right now for human connection.",
      "source": "target",
